#: ../../../source/Contributing-To-ROS.rst:4
msgid ""
"ROS (Robot Operating System) is an open-source ecosystem. We rely on "
"contributions from our community to help us grow and improve. This article "
"introduces the ways in which you can contribute to ROS."
