#: ../../../source/Contributing-To-ROS.rst:16
msgid ""
"ROS is an open source, federated collection of tools and libraries that is "
"built through contributions from our community. Whether you are a developer, "
"researcher, company, or student, your contribution helps us to grow and "
"improve."
msgstr ""

