"software so they can be understood and fixed. You can report any issues you "
"encounter with information to help developers quickly diagnose and resolve "
"the issue. If you are a beginner following a tutorial, for example, you can "
"include the steps needed to reproduce the problem. If you are a more "
"experienced contributor, you can also provide relevant technical details."
