msgid ""
"Read our documentation contribution guidelines: <Placeholder link to updated "
"contribution to docs article>."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Contributing-To-ROS.rst:259
msgid ""
"Browse the documentation issue list, and choose an issue to fix: `ROS "
"documentation issue tracker <https://github.com/ros2/ros2_documentation/"
"issues>`_"
msgstr ""

